---
description: >-
  A Person entity relates to four differently-aliased "Customer Account"
  variants, each via a relationship whose label contains a progressively
  longer chain of <br /> / <br/> line-break tags (one, two, three, and
  five breaks), testing multi-line relationship label rendering at
  increasing label heights.
config:
  logLevel: 1
---
erDiagram
  p[Person] {
    string firstName
    string lastName
  }
  a["Customer Account"] {
    string email
  }

  b["Customer Account Secondary"] {
  string email
  }

  c["Customer Account Tertiary"] {
  string email
  }

  d["Customer Account Nth"] {
  string email
  }

  p ||--o| a : "has<br />one"
  p ||--o| b : "has<br />one<br />two"
  p ||--o| c : "has<br />one<br/>two<br />three"
  p ||--o| d : "has<br />one<br />two<br/>three<br />...<br/>Nth"

---
description: >-
  Relationship labels with 1 to 5 `<br/>`-separated lines, across four
  entity-alias pairs under the elk layout.
config:
  layout: elk
